GAL22V10
SerializationTestBoard

NC BLAST ADS WR DEN ADREN DATLD DATEN OUTCLR NC NC GND
NC NC NC NC CLR3 EN3 OE3 EN2 PL2 EN PL VCC

/PL = /ADS
/EN = /ADREN * /DEN
/PL2 = /DATLD * /DEN * WR
/EN2 = /DATEN * /DEN * WR
/OE3 = /DEN * /WR
/EN3 = /DATEN * /DEN * /WR
/CLR3 = /OUTCLR

DESCRIPTION

This the logic for the pld on the serialization board meant to allow for 32-bit, 24-bit and 16 bit capture of different kinds.
